      "fixed_history": null,
      "reference_answer": "For travel to/from LHR, LGW or CDG, request wheelchair assistance at least 48 hours before departure; late requests are not guaranteed and depend on airport operations. Bringing a personal mobility aid also has a 48-hour reservation instruction. Wheelchair assistance is free; contact KQ for other routes and requirements.",
