            "text": "through their own bank.\n\nWhen making a purchase online:\n\n[List level 1] - Select iDEAL as the payment method.\n\n[List level 1] - You’re redirected to your bank’s online banking environment.\n\n[List level 1] - After logging in, confirm the payment.\n\n[List level 1] - The transaction is processed instantly, and once we receive payment confirmation, you will be sent an e-ticket and payment confirmation by e-mail.\n\nOptional Fees\n\nKenya Airways provides a variety of extra services that can be added to your flight with us in accordance with your individual travel requirements. The prices that would be charged upon purchase are listed below along with a list of these optional services.\n\nName Change Fees\n\nKenya Airways will collect service fees for every name change or correction on KQ operated flight bookings and not on an interline basis, using the following applicable fees:-\n\nName Correction",
            "score": 0.8671919600848661
          },
          {
            "rank": 2,
            "parent_chunk_id": "3308b1d7ba2ad2adcbf2b1885bd8ae7b927c2dc9aa7ad28dfa57b73ed15ce277",
            "document": "FAQs.docx",
            "section": null,
            "text": "extra legroom\n\n[List level 1] - Update contact information\n\n[List level 1] - Pay in advance for excess baggage\n\n[List level 1] - Request for refund\n\nCan I modify my flight details online if I booked it through a travel agent or another website?\n\nBookings purchased directly from Kenya-airways.com, Kenya Airways direct offices and preferred travel agents can be modified online through Manage My Booking.\n\nFor flights purchased from travel agents and 3rd party websites, you need to contact your travel agent in case of ticket refund.\n\nWhen booking online, where can I find the fare rules of my ticket?\n\nOur fare categories give you the flexibility that best suits your travel plans:\n\n[List level 1] - Best Buy\n\n[List level 1] - Economy\n\n[List level 1] - Economy flex\n\n[List level 1] - Economy Super flex\n\n[List level 1] - Business Best Buy\n\n[List level 1] - Business\n\nWhat is the refund policy on a ticket with different branded fares?\n\nIf your booking involves more than one branded fare, the most restrictive fare rule will apply to your whole itinerary. Fees for booking changes are non-refundable.\n\nHow do I edit or correct my name in my ticket?\n\nContact our Global Contact Centers or local offices to correct a name in a booking. Rules and fees apply.\n\nCan I change or transfer my ticket to another person?\n\nNo, you are not allowed to switch names or transfer your ticket to a friend or a family member.\n\nDo I need to call Kenya Airways to reconfirm my flight?\n\nIf your booking is successful, there is no need to call us. You can check in online or at the airport on the day of departure.",
            "score": 0.8553144435901439
          },
          {
            "rank": 3,
            "parent_chunk_id": "7c1085add8651d36fe8b0b9aaf74b87cf6abcf5cf2c2665ce7a52e827c3fe50e",
            "document": "Bookings and Self-Rebooking.docx",
            "section": null,
            "text": "such as weather conditions, air traffic control restrictions, or technical challenges, some flights may experience delays or cancellations.\n\nWe sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this may cause.\n\nConvenient Self-Rebooking at No Extra Cost\n\nTo minimize the impact on your travel plans, you can now easily rebook yourself to the next available or most convenient flight at no extra cost. Our online self-rebooking system allows you to manage your travel directly on our website or via the KQ mobile app.\n\nWhy the KQ Self Rebooking Service?\n\n[List level 1] - No penalty - The booking is free\n\n[List level 1] - Saves time—No need for call wait times\n\n[List level 1] - Stress free - Reduces the hassle of uncertainty\n\n[List level 1] - Convinient - Gives you control at your finger tips\n\n[List level 1] - Flexibility - Gives you multiple options to choose based on your preference\n\nHow to Rebook Your Flight:\n\n1. Visit the Self-Rebooking Portal (Link: https://digital.kenya-airways.com/servicing/self-reaccommodation/retrieve?_gl=1*j8r5nt*_gcl_aw*R0NMLjE3ODg1NDMzODAuQ2owS0NRancyT25VQmhDMkFSSXNBQ0t5ZmFFb0lmYk1xQVJEVWQxcjhCYXJGM1NGTU02REc0NlhnazgyZHFTYjV2WGt4Znhhcy1JbTlvY2FBa1diRUFMd193Y0I.*_gcl_au*MjAxNTQyNTUyMC4xNzg4NTQwNzM2*_ga*NDQ2Mjc2Mzk0LjE3ODg1NDA3Mzg.*_ga_JH7YGHV0KQ*czE3ODg1NDA3MzckbzEkZzEkdDE3ODg1NDM2MjEkajYwJGwwJGgxNDUwMzcyMDY1 )\n\n2. Enter your booking reference and last name\n\n3. Choose an alternative flight that suits your schedule.\n\n4. Confirm your new flight, with no additional charges.\n\nNeed Assistance?",
            "score": 0.8358239729976096
          },
          {
            "rank": 4,
            "parent_chunk_id": "f0a0cf741433c6d1637d1567429cfb17650989337ba789618429b2001a1758a5",
            "document": "Payments.docx",
            "section": null,
            "text": "Preceding paragraph:\nName Correction\n\nTable (Body/block 58):\n\nOpening row (context, not a declared header):\nRow 1: Column 1: [empty] | Column 2: Domestic PNRs | Column 3: International PNRs\nRow 2: Column 1: Amount Paid | Column 2: USD 15 | Column 3: USD 75",
            "score": 0.8318330811507723
