            "text": "or other value document held in our database.   \"ELECTRONIC TICKET\" means the Itinerary/Receipt issued by us or on our behalf, the Electronic Coupons and, if applicable, a boarding document, and shall have the same legal validity as a paper Ticket.\n\n\"FLIGHT COUPON\" means that portion of the Ticket that bears the notation \"good for passage,\" or in the case of an Electronic Ticket, the Electronic Coupon, and indicates the particular places between which you are entitled to be carried.\n\n\"FLIGHT DURATION\" means the scheduled time between departure and arrival of a flight as published in our timetable or confirmed at the time of booking.\n\n\"FORCE MAJEURE\" means unusual and unforeseeable circumstances beyond your control, the consequences of which could not have been avoided even if all due care had been exercised, including but not limited to acts of God, natural disasters, strikes, lockouts, civil commotion, acts of terrorism, governmental restrictions, public health emergencies, and air traffic control delays. Force Majeure shall not include events that are reasonably within your control such as failure to hold necessary travel documents or to arrive at the airport on time.\n\n\"ITINERARY/RECEIPT\" means a document or documents issued by us or on our behalf to Passengers travelling on Electronic Tickets that contains the Passenger's name, flight information and notices.",
