      "question": "Je, ninaweza kubadili tiketi ya daraja la uchumi kwenda daraja la biashara, na je, kiwango cha mizigo kitabadilika?",
      "fixed_history": null,
      "reference_answer": "An eligible Economy ticket can be upgraded through an online bid or airport/onboard options subject to availability. For bid upgrades (clause 21) and last-minute counter/onboard upgrades the original Economy baggage allowance remains. Do not promise the normal Business allowance for a buy-up or any other product unless its terms establish it. Ask which method if needed.",
